4. **Adapting the B19 oracle can touch tests the plan does not name.** `tests/test_fold.py::_equal_grain_pair(nodes)` returns ids and has six callers: the four `test_equal_grain_pair_*` tests and two fold loops. If it changes to take a grain list, those callers change too, which runs against Acceptance Criterion 5. Instead, add a grain-list form and have the node form call it, or wrap it inside B19.
